	<TextRow
		Label="msg_badgeparty_19"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えっ？　その　ジムバッジは
まだ　てに　いれてないけど……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T03:21:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T03:20:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えっ？　その　ジムバッジは
まだ　手に入れてないけど……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T03:21:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T03:20:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・未入手バッジを選択
・続けて18</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T03:21:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ESPW
サイキッカー♀</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T03:20:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t03pc0101_policeman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほんかん　ここに　ふにんしてから
なーんも　することが　ないのだ▼
よるは　そとに　だれも　いないし
へいわ　そのもの　だからなー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>本官　ここに　赴任してから
なーんも　することが　ないのだ▼
夜は　外に　だれも　いないし
平和　そのもの　だからなー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・朝になるといなくなる
・消すタイミングはzoneチェンジ＋時間参照
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T05:09:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POLICEMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
